  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#333333\"><a name=\"top\"></a></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"25\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n\n<font class=\"combo\" id=\"combos\" style=\"cursor:hand;\">Catalog*******</font>\n<div id=\"myDIV\">\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_alchemy/\" title=\"연금술[포션제작]\">Alchemy+</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_poisoning/\" title=\"포이즈닝[독바르기]\">Poisoning</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_taste/\" title=\"맛감정\">Taste ID</a><br>\n\t\t\t------------\n\t\t\t<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_blacksmith/\" title=\"스미스[대장장이]\">Black Smith+</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_mining/\" title=\"광부[광물캐기]\">Mining</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_armslore/\" title=\"암즈로어[장비지식]\">Arms Lore</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_item/\" title=\"아이템ID[아이템감정]\">Item ID</a><br>\n                        ------------\n\t\t\t<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_car/\" title=\"카펜터리[목공술]\">Carpentry</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_lumber/\" title=\"럼버잭[나무하기]\">Lumberjacking</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_thinker/\" title=\"팅거링[기계공기술]\">Tinkering</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_bow/\" title=\"보우크래프트[활제작술]\">Bowcraft</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_fishing/\" title=\"피싱[낚시]\">Fishing</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_ins/\" title=\"인스크립션[기록술]\">Inscription</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_tailor/\" title=\"재단사[재봉술]\">Tailor</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_cooking/\" title=\"쿠킹[요리]\">Cooking</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_begging/\" title=\"베깅[구걸]\">Begging</a><br><br>\n</div><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/jobs_logo.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"200\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font>&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"30\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/m.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"30\">INING</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"22\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"500\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"491\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 마이닝 \n                            기초 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/rare/icon_9.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"30\"></span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/m_logo.gif\" width=\"200\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/m_1.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">땅을 \n                            팔려면 삽자루나 곡괭이같은 도구가 필요합니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이러한 \n                            도구들은 팅거스킬이나 도구점에서 얻을 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측에 \n                            곡괭이는 약102번 삽자루는 51번을 캘 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/m_3.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">삽자루를 \n                            더블클릭후 타겟이 뜨면 원하시는 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">땅을 \n                            찍어 주시면됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\">\n<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(</span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020523121147/http://forg.co.kr:80/newbie/mining.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#990066\" face=\"Verdana\">Flash-초보자가이드</font></a></b></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/m_2.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일단 \n                            광물을 얻게되면 좌측 그림처럼 포지를 이용하여</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">원하시는 \n                            잉갓을 얻을 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\">\n<font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">(</span></font><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020523121147/http://forg.co.kr:80/newbie/mining_moving.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#990066\" face=\"Verdana\">Flash-초보자가이드</font></a></b></span><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/m_4.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측사진처럼 \n                            광물을 더블클릭하여 타겟이 뜨면 포지를 클릭하여</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">우측의 \n                            잉갓을 얻을 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">높은 \n                            스킬이 요구되는 광물일수록 녹일 때 실패율도 큽니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"491\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 해상광산</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"491\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"130\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/m_5.gif\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/m_6.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일명 \n                            해상광산이라고 하는 것으로 배를 타고</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">광석을 \n                            채취하는 방법입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">위에 \n                            그림처럼 미녹북쪽,코브,셔펜홀드지역에 있고</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 \n                            T2A지역에도 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">예전 \n                            피케이가 광산에서 끊임없이 출몰하였을 때는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5px;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">광물을 \n                            얻기에 더없이 좋은 장소 였습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"360\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" height=\"30\" width=\"348\">\n<p><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 스킬별 \n                            색잉갓 획득</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"30\" width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">잉갓</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"30\" width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">갑옷</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"30\" width=\"156\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">색깔</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"30\" width=\"56\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/ingot_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/ingot.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"156\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일반잉갓</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"56\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/dull_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/dull.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"156\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">덜쿠퍼</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"56\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">65</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/shadow_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/shadow.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"156\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">쉐도우</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"56\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">70</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/cooper.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/gold.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"156\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bot