an style=\"font-size:9pt;\">95</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/val_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"71\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"70\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/val.gif\" width=\"70\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"156\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">발로라이트(발로)</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"56\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">99</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"348\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">각각의 \n                            색깔잉갓은 해당스킬 때 땅을파서 얻을 수도 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">녹일 \n                            수도 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">각각의 \n                            광산위치마다 색잉갓의 리스펀자리가 있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">해당스킬이하일 \n                            때는 물론 일반광석이 나옵니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">만든갑옷을 \n                            녹여서 다시 잉갓으로 환원하는 스킬은</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스미스가아닌 \n                            마이닝이라는점을 상기하시길.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#A0965A\" bordercolordark=\"#999933\" bordercolorlight=\"#A0965A\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"499\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"491\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">■ 가고일곡괭이<a name=\"가고일\"></a></span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"130\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/val_ele_4.gif\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">윈드던전 \n                            또는 히스로스또는 숲주변에 가고일과스톤가고일이 \n                            있습니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이것을 \n                            잡게되면 운좋을 때는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가고일의 \n                            곡괭이를 얻을 수 있습니다</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/val_ele_3.gif\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">좌측의 \n                            사진은 가고일의 곡괭이 입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가고일의 \n                            곡괭이를 가지고 원하는</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">광산의 \n                            포인트에서 땅을 파게되면</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">여러 \n                            가지 엘리멘탈이 나오게됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/val_ele.gif\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일반잉갓이상의 \n                            엘리가 나옵니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">:일반잉갓포인트는 \n                            덜쿠퍼엘리</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아가파이트포인트는 \n                            베리테엘리</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">베리테포인트는 \n                            발로엘리</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">발로포인트는 \n                             발로엘리</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">총 \n                            8개종류의 엘리멘탈이 나옵니다</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"92\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"100\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/mining/val_ele_1.gif\" width=\"250\"></span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"394\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">각엘리멘탈은 \n                            특수능력을 지니고 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">발로엘리의 \n                            경우는 물리적데미지만 받습니다. 전사와광부의파티가 \n                            효과적입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 테이머의용도 안됩니다</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:5;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">오직 \n          